    },
    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 1667,
      "end": 1752,
      "text": "There are many. One drops the SRM and a Medium laser for an additional large laser.  "
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 1752,
      "end": 1755,
      "length": 1,
      "text": " "
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 1755,
      "end": 1947,
      "length": 190,
      "text": "The older, Refit versions are usually found in the Homestead March Posse units.  The New Builds are found in the Circus and Homestead Guards, who are most often raiding, working offensively."
